---
// A /news/<slug> that names no story. Paired with a 404 by the route, and with
// `noindex` — a URL that will never resolve should not accumulate in an index.
---

<section class="hero" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="hi">
    <p class="eyebrow">Amplified Thinker</p>
    <h1 class="hero-hl">Story not found</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="news-main">
  <div class="news-error">
    <h2>That story isn&rsquo;t here</h2>
    <p>The link may be mistyped, or the story may have been withdrawn. <a href="/news/">Browse the full feed</a> to find what you were after.</p>
  </div>
</div>
